Deploy the improved charm at {{ charm_path }} and verify it works.

1. Pack the charm.  Prefer `quick_pack` for speed; if it fails (unsupported plugin, override-build, missing uv.lock), fall back to `charmcraft_pack`.
2. Deploy or refresh with `juju_deploy` / `juju_refresh`.
3. Establish all relations.
4. Run `juju_wait` to confirm active/idle.
5. If COS relations were added, verify they are established.
